### Final Output Format

```
[RECON-COMPLETE]
[DURATION] {time spent on recon}
[SUBDOMAINS] {total discovered → live}
[ENDPOINTS] {total unique}
[API-ENDPOINTS] {count}
[PARAMETERS] {interesting count}
[JS-FILES] {analyzed count}
[SECRETS-FOUND] {types — never log actual values}
[TECHNOLOGIES] {stack summary}
[WAF] {type or none}

[PRIORITY-TARGETS]
1. POST /api/v1/users/{id}/profile — Sequential ID, no rate limit → [[idor]]
2. GET /search?q= — Reflected in page title → [[xss]], [[sqli]]
3. POST /api/webhook — Accepts URL parameter → [[ssrf]]
4. /graphql — Introspection enabled → [[graphql]]
5. POST /upload — Accepts multiple file types → [[file-upload]]
6. GET /api/v1/admin/users — Returns 403 (not 404) → [[idor]], [[jwt]]
...

[SESSION-LOG] Saved to notes/session_log.md
[NEXT-STEP] Load skills/index.md → select first skill from priority targets
```

